# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，检出时 Windows 批处理保持 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 明确声明为二进制，避免 Git 尝试做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.xmind binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary

# 文档与代码的语言统计口径（GitHub 的语言条不被模板/文档干扰）
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
